diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index b45a1a2..80d03a2 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: key columns whose values look like numbers (`2024`, `0042`) were right-aligned like amounts. Reports now always left-align key columns and right-align measures, and `render_table` left-aligns every column unless given `align`.
 - Grouping by several columns gives each its own column, headed by the CSV column name, instead of one `group` column joined with ` / `. A single key column is headed by its name too, and `aggregate` returns key values under their column names.
 - `--profile` describes each column (number or text, filled and blank cells) instead of reporting.
 
